          "dimension": "Oracle / Exchange-rate translation",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "The Aave post-mortem confirmed that wstETH's non-rebasing exchange rate must be converted correctly at the oracle layer; an automated cap that undershot the real rate triggered ~$21M in wrongful liquidations of healthy positions.",
          "source": "https://governance.aave.com/t/post-mortem-exchange-rate-misallignment-on-wsteth-core-and-prime-instances/24269"
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Centralization",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Lido controls the canonical wstETH contract and has unilaterally paused bridges and revoked support on nine networks via DAO vote, concentrating upgrade and bridge governance in a single protocol.",
          "source": "https://docs.lido.fi/contracts/wsteth/"
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Bridge / Cross-chain",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Lido's adoption of Chainlink CCIP as the sole official wstETH cross-chain framework reduces fragmentation risk but introduces single-vendor dependency for cross-chain mobility; the ZKsync pause demonstrated that individual bridge legs can be severed on short notice.",
          "source": "https://blog.lido.fi/announcing-partnership-with-chainlink-on-adopting-ccip-as-official-cross-chain-infrastructure-for-wsteth/"
        },
        {
